&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Tekion:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Positively disrupting an industry that has not seen any innovation in over 50 years, Tekion has challenged the paradigm with the first and fastest cloud-native automotive platform that includes the revolutionary Automotive Retail Cloud (ARC) for retailers, Automotive Enterprise Cloud (AEC) for manufacturers and other large automotive enterprises and Automotive Partner Cloud (APC) for technology and industry partners. Tekion connects the entire spectrum of the automotive retail ecosystem through one seamless platform. The transformative platform uses cutting-edge technology, big data, machine learning, and AI to seamlessly bring together OEMs, retailers/dealers and consumers. With its highly configurable integration and greater customer engagement capabilities, Tekion is enabling the best automotive retail experiences ever. Tekion employs close to 3,000 people across North America, Asia and Europe.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-family: &#39;arial black&#39;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is on site in Pleasanton, California&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;AI is changing the world — and at&amp;nbsp;Tekion,&amp;nbsp;we’re&amp;nbsp;shaping how our people grow with it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is not a role about replacing what Tekionites do. It’s about expanding what they’re capable of.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As our Director, AI Transformation &amp;amp; Enablement, you will architect the strategy, programs, and frameworks that help every Tekionite — from individual contributors to senior leaders — understand, embrace, and leverage AI as a genuine superpower in their everyday work. You’ll also use AI as a core part of how you and your team operate, actively modeling the future we’re building together.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This a brand-new role on a newly formed team — which means you’ll be building from the ground up, with the full support of the CPO and senior leadership. Some things are still taking shape, and that’s intentional: we want someone who thrives in that kind of environment, brings structure where it’s needed, and stays energized by ambiguity rather than derailed by it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;You’ll lead a lean but mighty team of 2+, partnering with cross-functional leaders across the business to define what the future of work at Tekion looks like — for a company that is itself building the AI products transforming an entire industry. With a small team, you’ll be expected to use AI — including building and deploying AI agents in Claude and other platforms — to multiply your team’s impact and model the kind of AI-powered working that you’re asking others to adopt.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workforce Planning &amp;amp; Job Architecture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Build and&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;a forward-looking workforce planning framework that maps current talent capabilities against future AI-augmented skill needs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Lead a comprehensive job architecture redesign that reflects how roles and work are evolving — ensuring clarity, equity, and alignment across job families, levels, and career paths&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Partner with HR Business Partners and business leaders to&amp;nbsp;identify&amp;nbsp;skill gaps and co-design targeted upskilling and reskilling pathways&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Develop a data-driven approach to talent planning — using people analytics and AI-powered tools to help&amp;nbsp;Tekion&amp;nbsp;make smarter, faster decisions about where and how to grow&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Advise on human-AI collaboration models and how roles may evolve as AI capabilities expand&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talent Management&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Embed AI fluency and enablement into key talent processes — including hiring, onboarding, performance management, and career development — in partnership with L&amp;amp;D, HRBPs, and Talent Acquisition&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Design capability frameworks and learning pathways that help&amp;nbsp;Tekionites&amp;nbsp;build careers that evolve alongside AI — not in competition with it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Identify&amp;nbsp;and develop AI champions and early adopters who can help scale enablement peer-to-peer across the organization&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ensure talent programs reflect the changing nature of work and position&amp;nbsp;Tekion&amp;nbsp;as a place where people come to grow into their best future selves&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Execution&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Lead, develop, and grow a lean team of 2+ people professionals — using AI tools and agents to multiply the team’s output and&amp;nbsp;operate&amp;nbsp;above your headcount&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Build and deploy AI agents in Claude and other platforms to automate and accelerate team workflows, from content development to program reporting and stakeholder communications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Set clear goals, OKRs, and success metrics — and track meaningful impact across all programs and initiatives&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Operate with a startup mindset in a fast-moving, resource-constrained&amp;nbsp;environment&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;be tenacious about achieving goals, resourceful in how you get there, and flexible as priorities evolve in this new and growing function&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Stay actively connected to the external AI transformation community — bringing best practices, emerging trends, and peer benchmarks back into&amp;nbsp;Tekion’s&amp;nbsp;strategy on an ongoing basis&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE’RE LOOKING FOR&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;10+ years of progressive HR, People Operations, organizational development, or management consulting experience, with at least 3–5 years managing teams (consulting background a strong bonus)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated experience leading AI, technology, digital transformation, or other large-scale transformation initiatives with a strong people and change management lens&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven&amp;nbsp;track record&amp;nbsp;in change management — ideally with formal&amp;nbsp;methodology&amp;nbsp;experience (Prosci/ADKAR, Kotter, or similar frameworks)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience personally&amp;nbsp;facilitating&amp;nbsp;and conducting AI transformation training and workshops at other companies — not just designing programs or managing others who deliver them&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience designing AI transformation training curricula or capability programs, with the ability to build and iterate content rapidly based on learner feedback&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated ability to build and use AI agents (e.g., in Claude, OpenAI, or similar platforms) to automate workflows, enhance productivity, or deliver better outcomes with a small team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Active, hands-on use of AI tools (generative AI, copilots, productivity assistants) as a meaningful part of your day-to-day professional work&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in workforce planning, organizational design, and/or job architecture redesign&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience working with and coaching senior leaders and executives through significant organizational change&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exceptional executive communication and storytelling skills — able to inspire, align, and influence at all levels without always having direct authority&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Human Resources, Organizational Development, Business, or a related field — or equivalent professional experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Background in a large management consulting or HR consulting firm (e.g., Deloitte, McKinsey, Mercer, Accenture, Korn Ferry) PLUS hands-on, in-house experience at a mid-size, high-growth tech company&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong, active external network within the AI transformation and future-of-work community — with relationships at peer companies doing leading AI internal adoption work&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with Workday HCM and/or AI-powered HR technology platforms&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Track record&amp;nbsp;of building and scaling people programs from the ground up in a fast-moving, resource-constrained tech environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience designing enterprise capability academies, AI literacy programs, or large-scale learning journeys&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exposure to automotive, enterprise SaaS, or B2B technology industries (a plus, not a requirement)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO YOU ARE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re a builder, a connector, and a genuine believer in the power of people. You’ve sat in enough boardrooms to speak the language of strategy, and you’ve spent enough time with front-line teams to know that lasting change only happens when people feel seen, heard, and supported.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re genuinely excited about AI — not just as a concept, but as a tool you actively use, explore with curiosity, and love helping others demystify. You’ve personally stood in front of rooms full of skeptics and turned hesitation into enthusiasm. You know that the most effective change leaders don’t mandate adoption — they make the path feel natural, exciting, and worth walking.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re comfortable with ambiguity and don’t need a perfect playbook to get started. This is a new team and a new function, and some things are still being defined. You bring structure where it’s needed, stay flexible when it’s not, and remain tenacious in pursuing what matters most. You can operate resourcefully with a lean team — and you know how to use AI to make two people feel like ten.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re well-connected in the AI transformation community. You know who else is doing this well, you’re in conversations with peers at other companies, and you bring those insights back to inform what Tekion builds. You’re not just following trends — you’re helping set them&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tekion, you’ll need all of that — and we can’t wait to see what you build.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base salary range for this role is $215,000 – $285,000 annually, based on experience, qualifications, and location. In addition to base salary, this role is eligible for equity, annual performance bonus, and Tekion’s full benefits package. Compensation is determined in a manner consistent with applicable law, and actual pay may vary based on individual qualifications and market factors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No Sponsorship for this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
