fiftyyears-billiontoone:greenhouse:47076.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Rare Opportunity to Shape the Future of Genomics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join a team of brilliant, passionate innovators determined to transform healthcare. At BillionToOne, we&#39;ve built a category-defining, publicly traded company on Nasdaq where transparency fuels trust, collaboration drives breakthroughs, and every contribution moves the needle on our mission to make life-changing diagnostics accessible to all. We don&#39;t just aim for incremental improvements; we build products that are 10x better than anything that exists today.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our scientists, engineers, sales executives, and visionaries are united by an unwavering commitment to changing the standard of care in prenatal and cancer diagnostics. This is where cutting-edge science meets human compassion, and every innovation you contribute helps remove the fear of the unknown from some of life&#39;s most critical medical moments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re driven by purpose, energized by innovation, and ready to help shape the future of precision medicine at scale, this is where you belong.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are seeking exceptional entrepreneurial builders to join BillionToOne&#39;s newly launched &lt;strong&gt;Founder in Residence Program&lt;/strong&gt; as a &lt;strong&gt;Director, Office of the CEO&lt;/strong&gt;. In this 12 to 18 month program, you will work directly with the CEO and Chief of Staff on the company&#39;s highest-priority strategic and operational projects, and graduate into a permanent senior operating role at the Director or Senior Director level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is one of the highest-leverage roles at BillionToOne. You will be deployed onto a portfolio of high-impact projects each quarter — from new product launches, to commercial strategy, to operational turnarounds, to incubating new business lines and capabilities. Your portfolio of 1-2 projects will be revisited each quarter so you are always working on what matters most to the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is a first-principles thinker, a builder, AI-native, and exceptionally sharp. You have founded a company, operated at the most senior level of a top scaleup, or built a track record of high-impact strategic work, and you are looking for your next high-leverage seat — one that gives you scale, mission, and direct CEO exposure without starting from scratch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is a hybrid (onsite 3 days/week) position and reports directly to the VP of Business Operations and Chief of Staff, with active co-sponsorship from the CEO.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own CEO-Priority Projects:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead one or more of BillionToOne&#39;s highest-priority strategic and operational initiatives each quarter, sourced directly from the CEO and Office of the CEO. Project types span new product launch support, commercial and go-to-market strategy, business development, operational excellence, competitive response, and the incubation of new business lines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Find Broken Things and Fix Them:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify under-performing processes, workflows, or functions. Diagnose root cause, design the fix, and drive execution end-to-end with cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead and influence cross-functional teams across Sales, Product, Lab Operations, Compliance, Reimbursement, Finance, BD, Legal, and HR. Build deep working knowledge of how each function operates through the projects you lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operate with AI:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive results in ambiguous, fast-moving environments. Use first-principles thinking and AI-native fluency to move faster than the company would otherwise be able to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CEO and Executive Partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; Participate in CEO meetings, present to the executive team on an ongoing basis, and serve as a trusted thought partner to the CEO and Chief of Staff on company-shaping decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6-10+ years of building or operating experience, with a track record of exceptional impact in entrepreneurial or builder-oriented environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One of the following backgrounds: founder of a company that has since been acquired, wound down, or moved on from; senior executive (COO, CPO, VP-level) who joined a top scaleup as one of its first 5 to 10 employees; or top-tier management consultant from MBB or a top boutique firm with healthcare or life sciences exposure, with some operational experience under your belt.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First-principles thinker with exceptional analytical horsepower&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Builder mentality — bias to action, comfort with ambiguity, ability to operate without a playbook&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-native fluency in using AI tools to move faster and amplify individual leverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication, including with executives and the Board&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine interest in molecular diagnostics and the BillionToOne mission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On-site position (relocation to SF Bay Area required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-To-Haves:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior exposure to healthcare, life sciences, molecular diagnostics, or other regulated industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of building 0 to 1 — new products, new functions, new business lines, or new operating mechanisms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Existing network in the founder community, YC ecosystem, or top scaleup operating community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits And Perks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working alongside brilliant, kind, passionate and dedicated colleagues, in an empowering environment, toward a global vision, striving for a future in which transformative molecular diagnostics can help millions of patients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open, transparent culture that includes weekly Town Hall meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to indirectly or directly change the lives of hundreds of thousands patients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multiple medical benefit options; employee premiums paid 100% of select plans, dependents covered up to 80%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extremely generous Family Bonding Leave for eligible employees (16 weeks, paid at 100%)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supplemental fertility benefits coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement savings program including a 4% Company match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase paid time off with increased tenure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Latest and greatest hardware (laptop, lab equipment, facilities)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free daily on-site lunches provided from top eateries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A variety of perks on campus (state of the art gym, restaurant)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free on-site EV charging (compatible with all EVs, including Tesla)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At BillionToOne, we are proud to offer a combination of (1) competitive base pay, (2) the opportunity for professional growth, and (3) industry leading company benefits (free healthcare options, 401k match, very generous fully paid&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-sheets-value=&quot;{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;At BillionToOne, we are proud to offer a combination of a (1) base pay range (actual amount offered is based experience and salary/equity options split that the candidate chooses) (2) generous equity options offering, on top of (3) industry leading company benefits (free healthcare options, 401k match, very generous fully paid paternal leave etc.).&amp;quot;}&quot; data-sheets-userformat=&quot;{&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:769,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:0},&amp;quot;11&amp;quot;:4,&amp;quot;12&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;parental&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;leave etc.).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For this position, we offer a total compensation package of $460,105&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;per year, including a base pay range of $203,651- $225,088&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;per year.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;BillionToOne is an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;For more information about how we protect your information, we encourage you to review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://billiontoone.com/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BillionToOne is a next-generation molecular diagnostics company on a mission to make powerful, accurate diagnostic tests accessible to everyone. Our revolutionary QCT molecular counting technology enhances disease detection resolution by over a thousandfold using cell-free DNA,a breakthrough that has already transformed the lives of over half a million patients worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.unityscreen.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unity Complete™&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the only non-invasive prenatal screen capable of assessing fetal risk for both common recessive conditions and aneuploidies from a single maternal blood sample. &lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.unityscreen.com/webinars/confirm-gc&quot;&gt;Unity Confirm™&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;enables non-invasive confirmation for high-risk screening results through the capture of intact circulating fetal cells using BillionToOne’s Fetal Cell Capture™ Technology. &lt;br&gt;Our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.northstaronc.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Northstar®&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; liquid biopsy test uniquely combines treatment selection with real-time monitoring, giving oncologists unprecedented precision in cancer care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From $0 to $400M+ annualized revenue run-rate in just 6 years. In 2025, we completed one of the most successful IPOs for a medical diagnostics company, building on nearly $400M in private funding,including our $130M Series D in 2024 and backed by world-class investors including Hummingbird, Adams Street Partners, Neuberger Berman, Baillie Gifford, and Premji Invest.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Recognition&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Forbes named us one of &lt;strong&gt;America&#39;s Best Startup Employers for 2025&lt;/strong&gt; and we&#39;re &lt;strong&gt;Great Place to Work certified&lt;/strong&gt;, with 100% of our people willing to go the extra mile, even as we&#39;ve scaled to over 700 employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Future&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Menlo Park with facilities in Union City, CA, and a new lab opening in Austin, TX in 2027, we&#39;re continuing to push the boundaries of what&#39;s possible in molecular diagnostics. We&#39;re just getting started.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ready to help us change the world, one molecule at a time? Learn more at&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.billiontoone.com&quot;&gt; billiontoone.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

fincapital-sumup:greenhouse:8018544002.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div data-testid=&quot;markdown-response&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;message&quot;&gt;SumUp es una empresa líder en tecnología financiera con presencia global, que impulsa el crecimiento de más de 4 millones de pequeños y medianos negocios en todo el mundo. Somos mucho más que un lector de tarjetas: somos el socio digital que los comerciantes necesitan para competir, crecer y prosperar en la economía actual.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-testid=&quot;markdown-response&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;message&quot;&gt;Desde soluciones de medios de pago, hasta poder manejar tu propia cuenta digital, catalogo de productos e inventario , facturación y servicios de préstamo, ofrecemos un ecosistema financiero completo diseñado para que los pequeños negocios se concentren en lo que mejor hacen: vender.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-testid=&quot;markdown-response&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;El equipo y el desafío&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-testid=&quot;markdown-response&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;message&quot;&gt;El equipo de Ventas es hoy en día el equipo mas grande de nuestra compañía en Chile. Nuestro equipo tiene una misión clara: expandir nuestra base de clientes conquistando comercios de tamaño mediano con una propuesta de valor financiera que realmente marca la diferencia en su día a día. Si eres de las personas que disfrutan estar en la calle, construyendo relaciones reales con clientes y liderando equipos que mueven el negocio, este rol es para ti.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-testid=&quot;markdown-response&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;¿Qué buscamos en nuestro/a Líder de Equipo de Ventas?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-testid=&quot;markdown-response&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;message&quot;&gt;Buscamos a alguien que no solo gestione un equipo, sino que lo inspire, lo acompañe en terreno a aproximadamente 10 ejecutivos y los lleve a superar sus metas. Que tenga las siguientes caracteristicas:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-testid=&quot;markdown-response&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li id=&quot;message&quot;&gt;Sea Apasionado/a por las ventas, con energía positiva y habilidad natural para conectar con clientes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Que posea mínimo 3 años liderando equipos de venta hunting en terreno, idealmente en industrias financieras o afines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Que disfrute salir a la calle: prospección en frio, acompañamiento de equipo y cierre de negocios&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Que se sienta cómodo/da en el manejo de herramientas como CRM, Excell y SQL para tomar decisiones basadas en datos&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Que tenga Experiencia en ventas&amp;nbsp;B2B y sector financiero (deseable)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Que tenga una genuina motivación por impactar en el crecimiento de los pequeños empresarios.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modalidad de trabajo: &lt;/strong&gt;presencial&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;¿Por qué unirte a SumUp?&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌍 Oportunidad de trabajar con SumUppers globalmente en productos fintech a gran escala usados por millones de negocios en el mundo, desde nuestra oficina en Santiago. Esta posición contempla una modalidad presencial&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌈 Compromiso con la Diversidad e Inclusión: sé parte de un lugar de trabajo que valora y promueve la diversidad, fomentando un entorno inclusivo donde las perspectivas de todos son respetadas y valoradas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚀 Acceso a nuestro programa de Virtual Stock Options: serás parte del éxito futuro de SumUp&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📚 Un presupuesto anual dedicado al aprendizaje y desarrollo que puedes usar para asistir a conferencias y/o avanzar en tu carrera a través de educación continua&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏖 Tiempo libre generoso: 20 días de vacaciones pagadas, más días festivos y licencias especiales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏥 Cobertura de salud y vida: en asociación con Zurich, ofrecemos seguro médico que incluye óptica, dental y seguro de vida&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💻 Beneficios adicionales: apoyo libre de impuestos para alimentación, transporte e internet en casa&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌴 Break4me: 1 mes de sabbatical después de 3 años de servicio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🔗 Bono de referidos: gana recompensas adicionales al referir talentos al equipo de SumUp&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Si te apasiona la tecnología, las ventas, liderar equipos de alto desempeño y estás interesado en integrarte a una empresa en donde tendrás oportunidades de aprendizaje constante,&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;¡Te esperamos!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

fincapital-sumup:greenhouse:8388078002.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paljonko haluat tienata myyjänä?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Euroopan suurimpiin fintech-alan yrityksiin kuuluva SumUp etsii myyjiä &lt;strong&gt;Field Sales Consultantin&lt;/strong&gt; rooliin kasvavaan tiimiin Ouluun,Tampereelle ja Turkuun.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tämä ei ole perusmyyntityö&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;rakennat oman asiakasportfoliosi&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;hankit itse asiakkaat&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;viet kaupat maaliin asti&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;vaikutat suoraan siihen mitä tienaat&lt;/li&gt;
