&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Keep up to date with everything cool that’s happening in the entertainment; think of yourself as the expert for new and trending experiences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
