&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Technical Requirements (Critical)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Must have at least 3 years of experience in PeopleSoft development and/or maintenance. Have hands-on experience in most of the following tools: PeopleCode, SQR, PeopleSoft Query, SQL, Application Engine, Application Package, BI Publisher, Component Interface, Integration Broker, Workflow, and Fluid Interface.&lt;/p&gt;
