&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is a hands-on production role for a strong individual contributor. It is well suited to a producer who wants to apply real craft to mission-driven work and to grow within an advocacy communications environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
